            <ArticleTitle>Click and Release: SO2 Prodrugs with Tunable Release Rates.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>818-821</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.orglett.6b03805</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Employing an intramolecular cycloaddition reaction, we have developed a series of SO2 prodrugs with tunable release rates with half-lives ranging from minutes to days.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
